<section class="phero"><div class="phero-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roofing-crew.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofing-crew-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofing-crew.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.08"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Services</li></ol></nav><p class="eyebrow on-dark">What we do</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services for Kentucky Property Owners</h1><p class="lede">From a single estimate review to full party-appraiser representation and neutral umpire work, every service is built around an accurate, defensible valuation of the loss.</p><p class="btns"><a class="btn coral" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ghost-l" href="/contact-us/">Free claim review</a></p></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="icards" data-stagger><a class="icard" href="/insurance-appraisal/party-appraiser-representation/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 01</small><h2>Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><span>We serve as your named appraiser once the appraisal clause is invoked on a Kentucky property claim.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/insurance-appraisal/home-insurance-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/winter-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/winter-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/winter-house.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 02</small><h2>Homeowners Insurance Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal help for Kentucky houses, condos under HO-6 policies and rental homes when the claim number falls short.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/insurance-appraisal/commercial-hoa-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/apartment-building.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/apartment-building-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/apartment-building.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 03</small><h2>Commercial &amp; HOA Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal for Kentucky retail, office, warehouse, church, apartment and condo association property claims.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/insurance-appraisal/roof-hail-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hailstones.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hailstones-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hailstones.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 04</small><h2>Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</h2><span>Independent appraisal for Kentucky roof and hail claims where repair scope or pricing is in dispute.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/insurance-appraisal/tornado-wind-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tornado-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tornado-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 05</small><h2>Tornado &amp; Wind Damage Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal for Kentucky tornado, straight-line wind and windstorm claims when the payout doesn’t match the damage.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/insurance-appraisal/water-damage-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/flooded-basement.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flooded-basement-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flooded-basement.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="795" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 06</small><h2>Water Damage Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal for burst pipe, appliance leak and sudden discharge claims in Kentucky homes and buildings.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/insurance-appraisal/fire-smoke-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-2.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-2-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire-2.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="680" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 07</small><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal for Kentucky fire, lightning, smoke, soot and contents claims when the settlement falls short.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/insurance-appraisal/ice-storm-freeze-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm-trees.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm-trees-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ice-storm-trees.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="734" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 08</small><h2>Ice Storm &amp; Freeze Damage Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal for Kentucky ice storm, ice dam, falling tree and frozen pipe claims when the payout is too low.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/insurance-appraisal/farm-equine-property-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tobacco-barn.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tobacco-barn-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tobacco-barn.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="817" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 09</small><h2>Farm, Barn &amp; Equine Property Appraisal</h2><span>Appraisal for Kentucky horse barns, tobacco and hay barns, pole barns, fencing and farm outbuilding claims.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/insurance-appraisal/second-look-estimate-review/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/desk-calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/desk-calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/desk-calculator.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 10</small><h2>Insurance Estimate Review</h2><span>A line-by-line review of your carrier’s Xactimate estimate, before or instead of formal appraisal.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/insurance-appraisal/neutral-umpire-services/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="641" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 11</small><h2>Umpire Services</h2><span>Neutral umpire services for Kentucky appraisals when the two party appraisers can’t reach agreement.</span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap faqsec"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Where to start</p><h2>Most files begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review answers that in days — and plenty of disputes close right there.</p><p class="btns"><a class="btn blue" href="/insurance-appraisal/second-look-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></p></div>
<div class="reveal"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one step?<svg class="ic chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><p>Yes. Many owners start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></details><details><summary>Do you handle farm and commercial property?<svg class="ic chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><p>Yes — barns, equine facilities, retail, office, warehouses, churches, apartments and condominium associations, as well as houses.</p></details><details><summary>Is appraisal only for hail claims?<svg class="ic chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><p>No. It applies to any covered loss where the amount is disputed: wind, ice, water, fire, fallen trees and more.</p></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="strip"><div class="wrap strip-in reveal"><div><h2>Carrier’s estimate doesn’t add up?</h2><p>Send it over with your photos. We’ll review it and tell you what we see — no obligation.</p></div><p class="btns"><a class="btn coral" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ghost-l" href="/contact-us/">Send the estimate</a></p></div></section>
